Local modifications (Exponential, NEW-53)
-----------------------------------------

Only build.rs changed; src/ is byte-identical to the upstream crate.

- The build verifies every prebuilt library archive it downloads (or copies
  from SHERPA_ONNX_ARCHIVE_DIR) against a pinned SHA-256 table (`PINNED`)
  before unpacking it, refuses an archive with no pin, deletes an archive
  that fails verification, and reuses an unpacked archive only when it
  carries the `.exp-sha256-verified` marker written after verification.
- On Windows the build picks the /MD (dynamic C runtime) archive unless the
  target enables `crt-static`, matching how the desktop's MSVC builds link.
- Cargo.toml gains the `sha2` build dependency and a header comment.
